{"id":"vod_zy360_67345","vodId":"67345","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":".hack//黄昏的腕轮传说","name_cn":".hack//黄昏的腕轮传说","date":"2003-01-01","year":"2003","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241101-1/688f47e349a2dedba2eda4998b62de03.jpg"},"summary":"一晃眼，上一次的“黄昏事件”已经过去四年了，风平浪静许久的TheWorld中再度发生了似曾相识的神秘事件。秀悟（皆川纯子配音）想都没想就进入了游戏之中，而玲奈（中原麻衣配音）亦尾随其后，一同和他们进入游戏的，还有米蕾尤（松冈由贵配音）。不了解这个世界的规则的秀悟很快就吃了瘪，在他和玲奈的面前，竟然出现了罕见的强大怪物铠战将军，而秀悟更是因此gameover，就在秀悟弥留之际，一个神秘少女出现在了他的眼前，用一个吻使得秀悟死而复生，复生后的秀悟成为了黄金腕轮的继承者。随着时间的推移，众人发现游戏中的世界似乎遭到了某种侵蚀和破坏，黑暗里，一个阴谋正在缓慢酝酿之中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-11-01 16:26:03","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241031/HXObdUYF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241031/0JLC1oLm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241031/fHuKHoms/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241031/03SzCy79/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241031/QJQ1Ua8Z/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241031/MKJSpgoW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241031/9MPvgHlL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241031/Nv0PWjJ2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241031/AHNnfbc6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241031/1qqTQdhH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241031/vf1trrX6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241031/4ixgGd4R/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:44:14.540Z"}